{"id":"20.03.ZigZag","contentHtml":"<p>This project is my solo deconstruction of the hit <code>ZigZag</code>, demonstrating fundamental skills in hyper-casual development. I was responsible for 100% of the work, including 3D assets.</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>The project proves mastery of key components of a successful mobile game: from procedural generation to polishing \"Player Feel\".</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2>Challenge</h2>\n<p>The key task is to <strong>deconstruct and recreate from scratch the core mechanics and \"player feel\"</strong> of the hit <code>ZigZag</code>, focusing on responsive <code>one-tap</code> controls and infinite procedural generation.</p>\n<hr>\n<h2>Engineering Solution</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Infinite Procedural Generation:</strong> Developed a system that generates an infinite path. For performance optimization, <strong>object pooling</strong> is implemented, allowing block reuse.</li>\n<li><strong>Responsive <code>one-tap</code> Controls:</strong> Implemented maximally responsive direction change mechanics with a focus on recreating the \"sticky\" feeling of the original.</li>\n<li><strong>Full Production Cycle:</strong> All assets, including 3D models of blocks (3 polygons), were created by me in <code>Blender</code>.</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2>Outcome</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Polished Prototype Created:</strong> Successfully recreated not only the gameplay but also the key \"player feel\" of the classic game.</li>\n<li><strong>Demonstration of Fundamental Skills:</strong> The project proves the ability to implement <strong>pillars of hyper-casual games</strong>: procedural generation, responsive controls, and optimization via <code>object pooling</code>.</li>\n<li><strong>Independence:</strong> Demonstrated the ability to bring a prototype to a finished state alone, including creating my own 3D assets.</li>\n</ul>\n","published":true,"title":"ZigZag","date":"2020-03","type":"project","tagsArray":["Demo","Mobile","Unity","C#","Blender"],"heroVideo":null,"shortDescription":"<p>Solo deconstruction of a hit game. <mark>Created a polished prototype from scratch</mark> featuring responsive <code>one-tap</code> controls and infinite generation.</p>\n","role":"solo","projectIcon":"/images/projects/20.03.ZigZag/icon.webp","cardBackground":"/images/projects/20.03.ZigZag/card.mp4?v=1765046987334","screenshots":[{"src":"/images/projects/20.03.ZigZag/screenshots/1.webp","width":532,"height":944},{"src":"/images/projects/20.03.ZigZag/screenshots/2.webp","width":532,"height":944}]}